autotune_progress is on for this run: true
every progress line has the documented shape: true
wall_s never decreases from one line to the next: true
one search_start and one search_done per report: true
each search_done names its report's outcome and timed count: true
each search_done retains its report's retried timing windows: true
each search printed one candidate line per attempt it reports: true
each search names its base compile before starting it: true
every candidate line names the attempt it starts: true
each search's candidate compile and timing seconds fit within its elapsed time: true
